@startuml
title Wholesale ODA components interaction

box "Mobile Network Operator"
participant "Application on behalf of\nNetwork Planning" as App
participant "Business Parnter\nProduct Order Capture & Validation" as MNO_POC
end box

box "Purchase Management"
participant "Business Partner\nProduct Offering\nQualifiction" as BP_POQ
participant "Business Partner\nQuote" as BP_Quote
participant "Business Partner\nProduct Order Delivery\nOrchestration and Mgmt" as BP_OrderOrch
end box

participant "Satellite Network Operator\n(detailed in other sequence diagrams)" as SNO

App -> App : 1. Infrastructure Demand raised
App -> MNO_POC : 2. TMFxxx Procurement Request\nIntent: Prepare inputs for procurement order
MNO_POC -> MNO_POC : 3. translate demand into\npartner purchase intent,\nmaps technical requirements\nto Product Offering criteria
MNO_POC -> MNO_POC : 4. orchestrates request enrichment with party,\nagreement, location data and other details\nneeded for Suppliers
MNO_POC -> BP_POQ : 5. query offering qualification
BP_POQ -> SNO : 6.
SNO --> BP_POQ : 7.
BP_POQ --> MNO_POC : 8. result

note over MNO_POC
  Based on received POQ data
  interacts with other systems and parties
  to build Initial Quote Request
end note

App -> MNO_POC : 9. TMFxxx Procurement Request\nupdate / select eligible offerings
MNO_POC -> BP_Quote : 10. partner quote request
BP_Quote -> SNO : 11.
note over BP_Quote : quote preparation
SNO --> BP_Quote : 12. approved
BP_Quote --> MNO_POC : 13.

note over BP_OrderOrch
  obtains final procurement approval,
  final technical validation
end note

MNO_POC -> BP_OrderOrch : 14. accepted
BP_OrderOrch -> SNO : 15.
SNO --> MNO_POC : 16.

MNO_POC --> App : 17. TMFxxx Procurement Request\nResult: OK, Prepared inputs for\nprocurement order to a supplier
App -> MNO_POC : 18. accept
MNO_POC -> BP_OrderOrch : 19.

note over BP_OrderOrch
  Prepares a Supplier Order including
  Quote ID, Product configuration, ...
end note

BP_OrderOrch -> BP_OrderOrch : 20. TMFxxx Supplier Order\nCreate procurement order
@enduml
